(595, '27507', '27507', 'Revolution Pro Lustre Highlighter Golden Rose Хайлайтер', NULL, NULL, 'Revolution Pro Lustre Highlighter Golden Rose Illuminator', NULL, NULL, 'Revolution Pro Lustre Highlighter Golden Rose Illuminator', '', '', '', '<p><strong> Объем: 9 gr</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></p>\n<p>Побалуйте себя роскошным сиянием с хайлайтером Revolution Pro Lustre Highlighter. Этот высокопигментированный хайлайтер в форме роскошной розы легко скользит по коже, подчеркивая черты лица и создавая великолепное мягкое переливающееся сияние.</p>\n<p>Хайлайтер заключен в потрясающую золотую блестящую зеркальную упаковку.</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Компоненты</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-item m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-item=\"\" data-expanded=\"true\" data-js-additional-ingredients=\"\">\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-container m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-container=\"3\" data-js-additional-ingredients-content=\"\">\n<p>INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): Mica, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Pentaerythrityl Tetraisostearate, Dimethicone, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Phenoxyethanol, Silica, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tin Oxide. [+/- MAY CONTAIN (PEUT CONTENIR): CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491 (Iron Oxides)].</p>\n</div>\n</div>', '<p><strong> Volum: 9 gr</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\n<p>Răsfățați-vă cu o strălucire luxoasă cu iluminatorul Revolution Pro Lustre. În forma unui trandafir luxos, acest iluminator foarte pigmentat alunecă fără efort pentru a defini trăsăturile feței și pentru a crea o strălucire superbă, moale, irizată.</p>\n<p>Evidențiatorul este inclus într-un pachet uimitor de oglindă cu sclipici auriu.</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\n<p>INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): Mica, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Pentaerythrityl Tetraisostearate, Dimethicone, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Phenoxyethanol, Silica, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tin Oxide. [+/- MAY CONTAIN (PEUT CONTENIR): CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491 (Iron Oxides)].</p>', '<p><strong> Volum: 9 gr</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\n<p>Răsfățați-vă cu o strălucire luxoasă cu iluminatorul Revolution Pro Lustre. În forma unui trandafir luxos, acest iluminator foarte pigmentat alunecă fără efort pentru a defini trăsăturile feței și pentru a crea o strălucire superbă, moale, irizată.</p>\n<p>Evidențiatorul este inclus într-un pachet uimitor de oglindă cu sclipici auriu.</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\n<p>INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): Mica, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Pentaerythrityl Tetraisostearate, Dimethicone, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Phenoxyethanol, Silica, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tin Oxide. [+/- MAY CONTAIN (PEUT CONTENIR): CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491 (Iron Oxides)].</p>', '27507', '27507', '27507', 350, 280, 70, 20, '9', 3, 1, 0, 0, 47, 86, 0, '', '', 'Нанесите на зону скул, спинку носа и галочку губ.', 'Aplicați pe pomeți, puntea nasului și linia buzelor.', NULL, 'INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): Mica, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Pentaerythrityl Tetraisostearate, Dimethicone, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Phenoxyethanol, Silica, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tin Oxide. [+/- MAY CONTAIN (PEUT CONTENIR): CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxid', 'INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): Mica, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Pentaerythrityl Tetraisostearate, Dimethicone, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Phenoxyethanol, Silica, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tin Oxide. [+/- MAY CONTAIN (PEUT CONTENIR): CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxid', NULL, 'Женский', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2023-08-24 00:00:00', '2023-06-06 16:16:39', 175, '5057566259576', 3, '5057566259576 MUR Pro Lustre Highlighter Golden Rose'),
(596, '27508', '27508', 'Makeup Revolution Forever Flawless Dynamic Eternal Палетка теней', NULL, NULL, 'Makeup Revolution Forever Flawless Dynamic Eternal Farduri de ochi', NULL, NULL, 'Makeup Revolution Forever Flawless Dynamic Eternal Farduri de ochi', '', '', '', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></p>\n<p>Почувствуйте себя безупречно с палеткой Forever Flawless Dynamic Eternal - теперь в мини формате. Вы будете избалованы выбором из 8 матовых, мерцающих и мраморных теней для век!</p>\n<p>Идеальные оттенки для растушевки, а так же сияющие и матовые составляют идеальную палитру для создания насыщенного макияжа.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\n<p>Simte-te impecabil cu Paleta Forever Flawless Dynamic Eternal - acum în format mini. Veți avea răsfățat de alegere cu 8 farduri de pleoape mate, strălucitoare și marmorate!</p>\n<p>Nuantele ideale pentru umbrire, precum si radiante si mate, alcatuiesc paleta perfecta pentru a crea un machiaj bogat.</p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\n<p>Simte-te impecabil cu Paleta Forever Flawless Dynamic Eternal - acum în format mini. Veți avea răsfățat de alegere cu 8 farduri de pleoape mate, strălucitoare și marmorate!</p>\n<p>Nuantele ideale pentru umbrire, precum si radiante si mate, alcatuiesc paleta perfecta pentru a crea un machiaj bogat.</p>', '27508', '27508', '27508', 215, 0, 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 46, 86, 0, '', '', 'Нанесите и растушуйте выбранные тени из палетки на веко.', 'Aplicați și amestecați fardul de ochi care ati ales.', NULL, 'Shade 1 INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): MICA, TALC, SILICA, POLYMETHYL METHACRYLATE, BORON NITRIDE, HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, NYLON-12, POLYETHYLENE, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAISOSTEARATE, PHENOXYETHANOL, PTFE, TRIETHOXYCAPRYLYLSILANE, LAUROYL LYSI', 'Shade 1 INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): MICA, TALC, SILICA, POLYMETHYL METHACRYLATE, BORON NITRIDE, HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, NYLON-12, POLYETHYLENE, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAISOSTEARATE, PHENOXYETHANOL, PTFE, TRIETHOXYCAPRYLYLSILANE, LAUROYL LYSI', NULL, 'Женский', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2023-08-24 00:00:00', '2023-06-06 16:16:39', 107.5, '5057566361934', 0, '5057566361934 MUR Forever Flawless Dynamic Eternal'),
(597, '27509', '27509', 'Makeup Revolution Glow Splendour Highlighter Lustre Хайлайтер', NULL, NULL, 'Makeup Revolution Glow Splendour Highlighter Lustre Illuminator', NULL, NULL, 'Makeup Revolution Glow Splendour Highlighter Lustre Illuminator', '', '', '', '<p><strong> Объем: 13 gr</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></p>\n<p>Сияющий хайлайтер сделают ваш образ завершенным, модным и интересным. Он переливается разными оттенками, которые очень гармонично подобраны. Средство обладает шелковистой запеченной текстурой, которая легко наносится.</p>\n<p>Он легко наслаивается и растушевывается, отлично держится до самого вечера, не осыпаются и не плывут. Makeup Revolution Glow Splendour Highlighter Lustre<strong> </strong>содержит природные компоненты, которые обеспечивают коже бережный и полноценный уход.</p>\n<p>Хайлайтер от Makeup Revolution представлен в стильной упаковке, которая станет настоящим украшением любого туалетного столика.</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Компоненты</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-item m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-item=\"\" data-expanded=\"true\" data-js-additional-ingredients=\"\">\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-container m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-container=\"3\" data-js-additional-ingredients-content=\"\">\n<p>MICA, MAGNESIUM MYRISTATE, PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM (MINERAL OIL, HUILE MINERALE), NYLON-12, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, MAGNESIUM ALUMINUM SILICATE, POLYBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, METHYLPARABEN. [+/- MAY CONTAIN (PEUT CONTENIR): CI 77891 (TITANIUM DIOXIDE), CI 77491 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77499 (IRON OXIDES)].</p>\n</div>\n</div>', '<p><strong> Volum: 13 gr</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\n<p>Un iluminator radiant vă va face aspectul complet, la modă și interesant. Strălucește cu diferite nuanțe, care se potrivesc foarte armonios. Produsul are o textură mătăsoasă copt care este ușor de aplicat.</p>\n<p>Este usor stratificat si umbrit, se pastreaza perfect pana seara, nu se sfarama si nu pluteste. Makeup Revolution Glow Splendor Highlighter Luster conține ingrediente naturale care oferă o îngrijire blândă și completă a pielii.</p>\n<p>Highlighter de la Makeup Revolution este prezentat într-un pachet stilat care va deveni un adevărat decor al oricărei mese de toaletă.</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-item m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-item=\"\" data-expanded=\"true\" data-js-additional-ingredients=\"\">\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-container m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-container=\"3\" data-js-additional-ingredients-content=\"\">\n<p>MICA, MAGNESIUM MYRISTATE, PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM (MINERAL OIL, HUILE MINERALE), NYLON-12, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, MAGNESIUM ALUMINUM SILICATE, POLYBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, METHYLPARABEN. [+/- MAY CONTAIN (PEUT CONTENIR): CI 77891 (TITANIUM DIOXIDE), CI 77491 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77499 (IRON OXIDES)].</p>\n</div>\n</div>', '<p><strong> Volum: 13 gr</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\n<p>Un iluminator radiant vă va face aspectul complet, la modă și interesant. Strălucește cu diferite nuanțe, care se potrivesc foarte armonios. Produsul are o textură mătăsoasă copt care este ușor de aplicat.</p>\n<p>Este usor stratificat si umbrit, se pastreaza perfect pana seara, nu se sfarama si nu pluteste. Makeup Revolution Glow Splendor Highlighter Luster conține ingrediente naturale care oferă o îngrijire blândă și completă a pielii.</p>\n<p>Highlighter de la Makeup Revolution este prezentat într-un pachet stilat care va deveni un adevărat decor al oricărei mese de toaletă.</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-item m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-item=\"\" data-expanded=\"true\" data-js-additional-ingredients=\"\">\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-container m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-container=\"3\" data-js-additional-ingredients-content=\"\">\n<p>MICA, MAGNESIUM MYRISTATE, PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM (MINERAL OIL, HUILE MINERALE), NYLON-12, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, MAGNESIUM ALUMINUM SILICATE, POLYBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, METHYLPARABEN. [+/- MAY CONTAIN (PEUT CONTENIR): CI 77891 (TITANIUM DIOXIDE), CI 77491 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77499 (IRON OXIDES)].</p>\n</div>\n</div>', '27509', '27509', '27509', 380, 0, 0, 0, '13', 0, 0, 0, 0, 47, 86, 0, '', '', 'Нанесите на зону скул, спинку носа и галочку губ.', 'Aplicați pe pomeți, puntea nasului și linia buzelor.', NULL, 'MICA, MAGNESIUM MYRISTATE, PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM (MINERAL OIL, HUILE MINERALE), NYLON-12, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, MAGNESIUM ALUMINUM SILICATE, POLYBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, METHYLPARABEN. [+/- MAY CONTAIN (PEUT CONTENIR): CI 77891', 'MICA, MAGNESIUM MYRISTATE, PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM (MINERAL OIL, HUILE MINERALE), NYLON-12, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, MAGNESIUM ALUMINUM SILICATE, POLYBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, METHYLPARABEN. [+/- MAY CONTAIN (PEUT CONTENIR): CI 77891', NULL, 'Женский', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2023-08-24 00:00:00', '2023-06-06 16:16:39', 190, '5057566469876', 0, '5057566469876 MUR Glow Splendour Highlighter Lustre'),
(598, '27510', '27510', 'Makeup Revolution Precious Glamour Illuminator Million Dollars Хайлайтер', NULL, NULL, 'Makeup Revolution Precious Glamour Illuminator Million Dollars Illuminator', NULL, NULL, 'Makeup Revolution Precious Glamour Illuminator Million Dollars Illuminator', '', '', '', '<p><strong> Объем: 8 gr</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></p>\n<section class=\"standart-content-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-8 col-lg-offset-4 col-md-8 col-md-offset-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n<div class=\"tabbable\">\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"product-description\" class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<p>Сияющий хайлайтер сделают ваш образ завершенным, модным и интересным. Он переливается разными оттенками, которые очень гармонично подобраны. Средство обладает шелковистой запеченной текстурой, которая легко наносится.</p>\n<p>Он легко наслаивается и растушевывается, отлично держится до самого вечера, не осыпаются и не плывут. Precious Glamour Illuminator Million Dollars<strong> </strong>содержит природные компоненты, которые обеспечивают коже бережный и полноценный уход.</p>\n<p>Средство сочетает в себе функции теней, румян и хайлайтера, имеют мелкий помол. Хайлайтер от Makeup Revolution представлен в стильной упаковке, которая станет настоящим украшением любого туалетного столика.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Компоненты</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-item m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-item=\"\" data-expanded=\"true\" data-js-additional-ingredients=\"\">\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-container m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-container=\"3\" data-js-additional-ingredients-content=\"\">\n<p>INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): MICA, TALC, HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, MAGNESIUM STEARATE, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAISOSTEARATE, POLYETHYLENE, PHENOXYETHANOL, PTFE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CI 77491 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77492 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77499 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77891 (TITANIUM DIOXIDE)</p>\n</div>\n</div>', '<p><strong> Volum: 8 gr</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\n<p>Un iluminator radiant vă va face aspectul complet, la modă și interesant. Strălucește cu diferite nuanțe, care se potrivesc foarte armonios. Produsul are o textură mătăsoasă copt care este ușor de aplicat.</p>\n<p>Este usor stratificat si umbrit, se pastreaza perfect pana seara, nu se sfarama si nu pluteste. Precious Glamour Illuminator Million Dollars conține ingrediente naturale care oferă o îngrijire blândă și completă a pielii.</p>\n<p>Instrumentul combină funcțiile de umbre, fard de obraz și iluminator, au o măcinare fină. Highlighter de la Makeup Revolution este prezentat într-un pachet stilat care va deveni un adevărat decor al oricărei mese de toaletă.</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-item m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-item=\"\" data-expanded=\"true\" data-js-additional-ingredients=\"\">\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-container m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-container=\"3\" data-js-additional-ingredients-content=\"\">\n<p>INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): MICA, TALC, HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, MAGNESIUM STEARATE, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAISOSTEARATE, POLYETHYLENE, PHENOXYETHANOL, PTFE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CI 77491 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77492 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77499 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77891 (TITANIUM DIOXIDE).</p>\n</div>\n</div>', '<p><strong> Volum: 8 gr</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\n<p>Un iluminator radiant vă va face aspectul complet, la modă și interesant. Strălucește cu diferite nuanțe, care se potrivesc foarte armonios. Produsul are o textură mătăsoasă copt care este ușor de aplicat.</p>\n<p>Este usor stratificat si umbrit, se pastreaza perfect pana seara, nu se sfarama si nu pluteste. Precious Glamour Illuminator Million Dollars conține ingrediente naturale care oferă o îngrijire blândă și completă a pielii.</p>\n<p>Instrumentul combină funcțiile de umbre, fard de obraz și iluminator, au o măcinare fină. Highlighter de la Makeup Revolution este prezentat într-un pachet stilat care va deveni un adevărat decor al oricărei mese de toaletă.</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-item m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-item=\"\" data-expanded=\"true\" data-js-additional-ingredients=\"\">\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-container m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-container=\"3\" data-js-additional-ingredients-content=\"\">\n<p>INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): MICA, TALC, HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, MAGNESIUM STEARATE, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAISOSTEARATE, POLYETHYLENE, PHENOXYETHANOL, PTFE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CI 77491 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77492 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77499 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77891 (TITANIUM DIOXIDE).</p>\n</div>\n</div>', '27510', '27510', '27510', 270, 216, 54, 20, '8', 3, 1, 0, 0, 47, 86, 0, '', '', 'Нанесите на зону скул, спинку носа и галочку губ.', 'Aplicați pe pomeți, puntea nasului și linia buzelor.', NULL, 'INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): MICA, TALC, HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, MAGNESIUM STEARATE, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAISOSTEARATE, POLYETHYLENE, PHENOXYETHANOL, PTFE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CI 77491 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77492 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77499 (IRON OXI', 'INGREDIENTS (INGRÃ‰DIENTS): MICA, TALC, HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE, DIMETHICONE, MAGNESIUM STEARATE, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAISOSTEARATE, POLYETHYLENE, PHENOXYETHANOL, PTFE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CI 77491 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77492 (IRON OXIDES), CI 77499 (IRON OXI', NULL, 'Ж