(648, '28472', '28472', 'Makeup Revolution Rehab Coconut Restore Fixing Spray Фиксирующий спрей для макияжа', NULL, NULL, 'Makeup Revolution Rehab Coconut Restore Fixing Spray Fixator pentru machiaj', NULL, NULL, 'Makeup Revolution Rehab Coconut Restore Fixing Spray Fixator pentru machiaj', '', '', '', '<p><strong> Объем: 90 ml</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></p>\n<p>Фиксирующий спрей Revolution Coconut Restore Rehab идеально подходит для закрепления макияжа и питания кожи. Его формула содержит экстракт кокоса и керамиды, которые увлажняют кожу, делая ее мягкой и прощаясь с сухой и шелушащейся кожей.</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Компоненты</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-item m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-item=\"\" data-expanded=\"true\" data-js-additional-ingredients=\"\">\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-container m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-container=\"3\" data-js-additional-ingredients-content=\"\">\n<p>AQUA (WATER, EAU), ALCOHOL DENAT., CORN STARCH MODIFIED,ROSA RUGOSA FLOWER WATER, PHENOXYETHANOL, PPG-26-BUTETH-26, PARFUM (FRAGRANCE), BENZYL BENZOATE, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, PANTHENOL, NIACINAMIDE, ROSA CANINA FRUIT OIL, PROPANEDIOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL, COCOS NUCIFERA (COCONUT) FRUIT EXTRACT, TOCOPHEROL, 1,2-HEXANEDIOL, HYDROXYACETOPHENONE, CENTAUREA CYANUS FLOWER EXTRACT, SODIUM HYALURONATE, DRYOPTERIS FILIX-MAS ROOT EXTRACT, CETRARIA ISLANDICA EXTRACT, PEAT EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Применение</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"product-info__description\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"extra\">\n<div>\n<p>Закрыть глаза, нанести спрей на лицо на расстоянии примерно 20 см.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '<p><strong> Volum: 90 ml</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\n<p>Revolution Coconut Restore Rehab Fixing Spray este ideal pentru fixarea machiajului și hrănirea pielii. Formula sa conține extract de nucă de cocos și ceramidă, care hidratează pielea, făcând-o moale și spunând la revedere pielii uscate și descuamate.</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-item m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-item=\"\" data-expanded=\"true\" data-js-additional-ingredients=\"\">\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-container m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-container=\"3\" data-js-additional-ingredients-content=\"\">\n<p>AQUA (WATER, EAU), ALCOHOL DENAT., CORN STARCH MODIFIED,ROSA RUGOSA FLOWER WATER, PHENOXYETHANOL, PPG-26-BUTETH-26, PARFUM (FRAGRANCE), BENZYL BENZOATE, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, PANTHENOL, NIACINAMIDE, ROSA CANINA FRUIT OIL, PROPANEDIOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL, COCOS NUCIFERA (COCONUT) FRUIT EXTRACT, TOCOPHEROL, 1,2-HEXANEDIOL, HYDROXYACETOPHENONE, CENTAUREA CYANUS FLOWER EXTRACT, SODIUM HYALURONATE, DRYOPTERIS FILIX-MAS ROOT EXTRACT, CETRARIA ISLANDICA EXTRACT, PEAT EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\n<p>Inchide ochii, pulverizeaza pe fata la o distanta de aproximativ 20 cm.</p>', '<p><strong> Volum: 90 ml</strong></p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\n<p>Revolution Coconut Restore Rehab Fixing Spray este ideal pentru fixarea machiajului și hrănirea pielii. Formula sa conține extract de nucă de cocos și ceramidă, care hidratează pielea, făcând-o moale și spunând la revedere pielii uscate și descuamate.</p>\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-item m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-item=\"\" data-expanded=\"true\" data-js-additional-ingredients=\"\">\n<div class=\"b-pdp_accordion-container m-accordion-expanded\" data-js-accordion-container=\"3\" data-js-additional-ingredients-content=\"\">\n<p>AQUA (WATER, EAU), ALCOHOL DENAT., CORN STARCH MODIFIED,ROSA RUGOSA FLOWER WATER, PHENOXYETHANOL, PPG-26-BUTETH-26, PARFUM (FRAGRANCE), BENZYL BENZOATE, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, PANTHENOL, NIACINAMIDE, ROSA CANINA FRUIT OIL, PROPANEDIOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL, COCOS NUCIFERA (COCONUT) FRUIT EXTRACT, TOCOPHEROL, 1,2-HEXANEDIOL, HYDROXYACETOPHENONE, CENTAUREA CYANUS FLOWER EXTRACT, SODIUM HYALURONATE, DRYOPTERIS FILIX-MAS ROOT EXTRACT, CETRARIA ISLANDICA EXTRACT, PEAT EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\n<p>Inchide ochii, pulverizeaza pe fata la o distanta de aproximativ 20 cm.</p>', '28472', '28472', '28472', 225, 0, 0, 0, '90', 0, 0, 0, 0, 38, 86, 0, '', '', 'Распылите средство на законченный макияж на расстоянии 20 см.', 'Pulverizați machiajul finit la o distanță de 20 cm.', NULL, 'AQUA (WATER, EAU), ALCOHOL DENAT., CORN STARCH MODIFIED,ROSA RUGOSA FLOWER WATER, PHENOXYETHANOL, PPG-26-BUTETH-26, PARFUM (FRAGRANCE), BENZYL BENZOATE, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, PANTHENOL, NIACINAMIDE, ROSA ', 'AQUA (WATER, EAU), ALCOHOL DENAT., CORN STARCH MODIFIED,ROSA RUGOSA FLOWER WATER, PHENOXYETHANOL, PPG-26-BUTETH-26, PARFUM (FRAGRANCE), BENZYL BENZOATE, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, PANTHENOL, NIACINAMIDE, ROSA ', NULL, 'Женский', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2023-08-24 00:00:00', '2023-06-06 16:16:39', 112.5, '5057566442862', 0, '5057566