fețe din fibre sintetice pentru aplicarea și amestecarea umbrelor.</p>', '19255', '19255', '19255', 250, 200, 50, 20, '', 37, 1, 0, 0, 46, 86, 0, '', '', 'Нанесите и растушуйте выбранные тени из палетки на веко.', 'Aplicați și amestecați fardul de ochi care ati ales.', NULL, 'Shades 1,3,5,6,12,14: Talc, Mica, Magnesium Stearate, Ethylhexyl Palmitate,Paraffinum Liquidum/Mineral Oil/Huile Minerale, Dimethicone, Polybutene,Methylparaben, Propylparaben. [+/-: Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499)', 'Shades 1,3,5,6,12,14: Talc, Mica, Magnesium Stearate, Ethylhexyl Palmitate,Paraffinum Liquidum/Mineral Oil/Huile Minerale, Dimethicone, Polybutene,Methylparaben, Propylparaben. [+/-: Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499)', NULL, 'Женский', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2023-07-07 00:00:00', '2023-06-06 16:16:40', 125, '5057566092715', 31, '5057566092715/5057566043335 MUR  Re-Loaded Palette Basic Mattes'),
