p>\n<p>Răsuciți părul.</p>\n<div class=\"clearboth\"> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearboth\"> </div>\n<div class=\"mk-shortcode mk-padding-shortcode\"> </div>\n<div class=\"clearboth\"> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"mk-image-shortcode mk-shortcode   align-center simple-frame  \">\n<div class=\"mk-image-inner\"><img class=\"hidden-xs lightbox-\" title=\"\" src=\"https://www.invisibobble.com/wp-content/uploads/bfi_thumb/2018-269-F_Invisibobble_A01_0050_step3-oauzkydldyaubju1mt353xzs98y3fu533ul5t8u2e8.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n<div class=\"clearboth\"> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mk-text-block  \">\n<p>2</p>\n<p>Rotiți-l într-o mănunchi.</p>\n<div class=\"clearboth\"> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearboth\"> </div>\n<div class=\"mk-shortcode mk-padding-shortcode\"> </div>\n<div class=\"clearboth\"> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"mk-image-shortcode mk-shortcode   align-center simple-frame  \">\n<div class=\"mk-image-inner\"><img class=\"hidden-xs lightbox-\" title=\"\" src=\"https://www.invisibobble.com/wp-content/uploads/bfi_thumb/2018-269-F_Invisibobble_A01_0050_step4-oauzl24y5afzlzol0upndx1mmsfkamk0gd73qcohpc.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n<div class=\"clearboth\"> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mk-text-block  \">\n<p>3</p>\n<p>Poziționați BUNSTAR paralel cu capul, astfel încât dinții să fie direcționați către mănunchi.</p>\n<div class=\"clearboth\"> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearboth\"> </div>\n<div class=\"mk-shortcode mk-padding-shortcode\"> </div>\n<div class=\"clearboth\"> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div cl