(2664, '26780', '26780', 'CLARINS Fluide Après-Rasage Крем после бритья', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Fluide Après-Rasage Crema dupa ras', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Fluide Après-Rasage Crema dupa ras', '', '', '', '<p><strong> Объем: 75 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__section\">\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text what-is-it-accordion__clamp-text what-is-it-text-js\">Не содержащий спирта крем с легкой нежирной текстурой моментально успокаивает кожу после бритья и дарит ей ощущение комфорта.<br />\r\nВходящие в состав формулы масла карите и марулы оказывают увлажняющее и восстанавливающее действие. А экстракты портулака, центеллы азиатской и синеголовника альпийского не только устраняют ощущение жжения и раздражение после бритья, но и делают кожу менее чувствительной к воздействию лезвия по мере использования крема.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"what-is-it-accordion__list\">\r\n	<li class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text-medium\">Тип кожи: </span>Для любого типа кожи</li>\r\n	<li class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text-medium\">Текстура: </span>Флюид</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"discover-more-benefit-section__title\">Ключевые преимущества</div>\r\n<div class=\"discover-more-benefit-section__text\">\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Моментально успокаивает кожу Увлажняет Постепенно снижает чувствительность кожи к бритью</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__section\">\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__title\">Clarins +</div>\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text\">Максимальный комфорт</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Компоненты</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE, GLYCERIN, DIMETHICONE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER, CETEARYL ETHYLHEXANOATE, SCLEROCARYA BIRREA SEED OIL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, POLYACRYLAMIDE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, C13-14 ISOPARAFFIN, HIEROCHLOE ODORATA EXTRACT, PALMITOYL PROLINE, TOCOPHEROL, PERSEA GRATISSIMA (AVOCADO) OIL UNSAPONIFIABLES, TETRASODIUM EDTA, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, MAGNESIUM PALMITOYL GLUTAMATE, SODIUM PALMITOYL SARCOSINAT, ERYNGIUM ALPINUM FLOWER EXTRACT, LAURETH-7, BIOSACCHARIDE GUM-4, CENTELLA ASIATICA EXTRACT, PALMITIC ACID, THERMUS THERMOPHILLUS FERMENT, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, PORTULACA OLERACEA EXTRACT, LAPSANA COMMUNIS FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT, ALPINIA OFFICINARUM ROOT EXTRACT, CAMELLIA SINENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, RHODIOLA ROSEA ROOT EXTRACT, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM LAURYL SULFATE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, HEXYL CINNAMAL, BUTYLPHENYL METHYLPROPIONAL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, BENZYL BENZOATE, CITRAL, [V1550B] AQUA/WATER/EAU. GLYCERIN. DIISOPROPYL SEBACATE. PENTYLENE GLYCOL. BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER. AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER. CETEARYL ETHYLHEXANOATE. SCLEROCARYA BIRREA SEED OIL. SQUALANE. PARFUM/FRAGRANCE. PROPYLENE GLYCOL. ALCOHOL. POLYACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER-6. ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN. PALMITOYL PROLINE. TOCOPHEROL. PERSEA GRATISSIMA (AVOCADO) OIL UNSAPONIFIABLES. TETRASODIUM EDTA. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. MAGNESIUM PALMITOYL GLUTAMATE. SODIUM PALMITOYL SARCOSINATE. GYMNEMA SYLVESTRE LEAF EXTRACT. RIBES NIGRUM (BLACK CURRANT) BUD EXTRACT. PALMITIC ACID. MARRUBIUM VULGARE EXTRACT. SEMPERVIVUM TECTORUM EXTRACT. HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL. T-BUTYL ALCOHOL. HIEROCHLOE ODORATA EXTRACT. PHENETHYL ALCOHOL. FURCELLARIA LUMBRICALIS EXTRACT. LAPSANA COMMUNIS FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT. MARIS SAL/SEA SALT/SEL MARIN [V1550C]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Применение</strong></span></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--left flex-align-vertical-center\">\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--text\">\r\n<div class=\"full-width\">Наносите легкими разглаживающими движениями, уделяя особое внимание участкам, испытывающим ощущение жжения.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--right flex-align-vertical-center\">\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__image flex-align-vertical-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>', '<p><strong> Volum: 75 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Crema fără alcool, cu o textură ușoară, non-grasă, calmează instantaneu pielea după bărbierit și o lasă confortabilă.<br />\r\nUntul de shea si uleiurile de marula incluse in formula au efect hidratant si regenerant. Iar extractele de purslane, centella asiatica și eryngium alpin nu numai că elimină senzația de arsură și iritația după bărbierit, dar fac pielea mai puțin sensibilă la efectele lamei pe măsură ce se folosește crema.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Tip de piele: Pentru orice tip de piele</li>\r\n	<li>Textura: fluid</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Beneficii cheie</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Calmează instantaneu pielea Hidratează Reduce treptat sensibilitatea pielii la bărbierit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Clarins +<br />\r\nConfort maxim</p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE, GLYCERIN, DIMETHICONE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER, CETEARYL ETHYLHEXANOATE, SCLEROCARYA BIRREA SEED OIL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, POLYACRYLAMIDE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, C13-14 ISOPARAFFIN, HIEROCHLOE ODORATA EXTRACT, PALMITOYL PROLINE, TOCOPHEROL, PERSEA GRATISSIMA (AVOCADO) OIL UNSAPONIFIABLES, TETRASODIUM EDTA, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, MAGNESIUM PALMITOYL GLUTAMATE, SODIUM PALMITOYL SARCOSINAT, ERYNGIUM ALPINUM FLOWER EXTRACT, LAURETH-7, BIOSACCHARIDE GUM-4, CENTELLA ASIATICA EXTRACT, PALMITIC AC