ritația după bărbierit, dar fac pielea mai puțin sensibilă la efectele lamei pe măsură ce se folosește crema.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Tip de piele: Pentru orice tip de piele</li>\r\n	<li>Textura: fluid</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Beneficii cheie</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Calmează instantaneu pielea Hidratează Reduce treptat sensibilitatea pielii la bărbierit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Clarins +<br />\r\nConfort maxim</p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE, GLYCERIN, DIMETHICONE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER, CETEARYL ETHYLHEXANOATE, SCLEROCARYA BIRREA SEED OIL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, POLYACRYLAMIDE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, C13-14 ISOPARAFFIN, HIEROCHLOE ODORATA EXTRACT, PALMITOYL PROLINE, TOCOPHEROL, PERSEA GRATISSIMA (AVOCADO) OIL UNSAPONIFIABLES, TETRASODIUM EDTA, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, MAGNESIUM PALMITOYL GLUTAMATE, SODIUM PALMITOYL SARCOSINAT, ERYNGIUM ALPINUM FLOWER EXTRACT, LAURETH-7, BIOSACCHARIDE GUM-4, CENTELLA ASIATICA EXTRACT, PALMITIC ACID, THERMUS THERMOPHILLUS FERMENT, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, PORTULACA OLERACEA EXTRACT, LAPSANA COMMUNIS FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT, ALPINIA OFFICINARUM ROOT EXTRACT, CAMELLIA SINENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, RHODIOLA ROSEA ROOT EXTRACT, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM LAURYL SULFATE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, HEXYL CINNAMAL, BUTYLPHENYL METHYLPROPIONAL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, BENZYL BENZOATE, CITRAL, [V1550B] AQUA/WATER/EAU. GLYCERIN. DIISOPROPYL SEBACATE. PENTYLENE GLYCOL. BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER. AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER. CETEARYL ETHYLHEXANOATE. SCLEROCARYA BIRREA SEED OIL. SQUALANE. PARFUM/FRAGRANCE. PROPYLENE GLYCOL. ALCOHOL. POLYACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER-6. ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN. PALMITOYL PROLINE. TOCOPHEROL. PERSEA GRATISSIMA (AVOCADO) OIL UNSAPONIFIABLES. TETRASODIUM EDTA. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. MAGNESIUM PALMITOYL GLUTAMATE. SODIUM PALMITOYL SARCOSINATE. GYMNEMA SYLVESTRE LEAF EXTRACT. RIBES NIGRUM (BLACK CURRANT) BUD EXTRACT. PALMITIC ACID. MARRUBIUM VULGARE EXTRACT. SEMPERVIVUM TECTORUM EXTRACT. HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL. T-BUTYL ALCOHOL. HIEROCHLOE ODORATA EXTRACT. PHENETHYL ALCOHOL. FURCELLARIA LUMBRICALIS EXTRACT. LAPSANA COMMUNIS FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT. MARIS SAL/SEA SALT/SEL MARIN [V1550C]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\r\n<p>Aplicați cu mișcări ușoare de netezire, acordând o atenție deosebită zonelor care experimentează o senzație de arsură.</p>', '26780', '26780', '26780', 700, 0, 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 10, 80, 0, '', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 'Мужской', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2023-08-01 00:00:00', '2023-07-28 17:30:02', 420, '3666057010798', 0, '80081606 MEN AFTER SHAVE SOOTHER 75ML \" CLARINS\"'),
(2665, '26781', '26781', 'CLARINS Jeunesse des Pieds Крем для ног', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Jeunesse des Pieds Crema pentru piciori', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Jeunesse des Pieds Crema pentru piciori', '', '', '', '<p><strong> Объем: 125 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__section\">\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text what-is-it-accordion__clamp-text what-is-it-text-js\">Крем с насыщенной, но нежирной текстурой быстро впитывается и смягчает склонную к сухости кожу ступней благодаря входящим в его состав маслам кешью и карите. Экстракт арники снимает усталость и дарит ощущение комфорта. Экстракт мирры укрепляет ногти. Крем помогает сохранить красоту и нежность ступней от щиколоток до кончиков пальцев.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"what-is-it-accordion__list\">\r\n	<li class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text-medium\">Тип кожи: </span>Нормальная, Сухая</li>\r\n	<li class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text-medium\">Текстура: </span>Крем</li>\r\n	<li class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text-medium\">Применение: </span>Используйте каждый день утром и/или вечером</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Компоненты</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU, GLYCERIN, PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM/MINERAL OIL/HUILE MINERALE, ALCOHOL, GLYCERYL STEARATE SE, STEARIC ACID, CETYL ALCOHOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, CYCLOMETHICONE, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL DICAPRYLATE/DICAPRATE, OCTYLDODECANOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER UNSAPONIFIABLES, CETYL PALMITATE, SODIUM MAGNESIUM SILICATE, ANACARDIUM OCCIDENTALE (CASHEW) SEED OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ARNICA MONTANA FLOWER EXTRACT, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, POLYSORBATE 20, ALLANTOIN, CARBOMER, COMMIPHORA MYRRHA RESIN EXTRACT, THYMUS ZYGIS FLOWER OIL, BHT, BENZYL SALICYLATE, LINALOOL, BUTYLPHENYL METHYLPROPIONAL, LIMONENE, HEXYL CINNAMAL, CITRONELLOL, EUGENOL, CITRAL, [C1664B]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Применение</strong></span></div>\r\n<p>Наносите утром и/или вечером легкими массирующими движениями от пальцев по направлению к лодыжкам. Против мозолей регулярно используйте для ног отшелушивающее средство.</p>', '<p><strong> Volum: 125 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Cu o textură bogată, dar negrasă, crema se absoarbe rapid pentru a înmuia picioarele uscate cu caju și unt de shea. Extractul de arnică ameliorează oboseala și oferă o senzație de confort. Extractul de smirnă întărește unghiile. Crema ajută la păstrarea frumuseții și sensibilității picioarelor de la glezne până la degete.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Tip de piele: normală, uscată</li>\r\n	<li>Textura: crema</li>\r\n	<li>Aplicare: Se foloseste in fiecare zi dimineata si/sau seara</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>AQUA/WATER/EAU, GLYCERIN, PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM/MINERAL OIL/HUILE MINERALE, ALCOHOL, GLYCERYL STEARATE SE, STEARIC ACID, CETYL ALCOHOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, CYCLOMETHICONE, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL DICAPRYLATE/DICAPRATE, OCTYLDODECANOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER UNSAPONIFIABLES, CETYL PALMITATE, SODIUM MAGNESIUM SILICATE, ANACARDIUM OCCIDENTALE (CASHEW) SEED OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ARNICA MONTANA FLOWER EXTRACT, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, POLYSORBATE 20, ALLANTOIN, CARBOMER, COMMIPHORA MYRRHA RESIN EXTRACT, THYMUS ZYGIS FLOWER OIL, BHT, BENZYL SALICYLATE, LINALOOL, BUTYLPHENYL METHYLPROPIONAL, LIMONENE, HEXYL CINNAMAL, CITRONELLOL, EUGENOL, CITRAL, [C1664B]</p>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\r\n<p>Se aplica dimineata si/sau seara cu miscari usoare de masaj de la degete catre glezne. Pentru calusuri, folosiți în mod regulat un exfoliant pentru picioare.</p>', '<p><strong> Volum: 125 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Cu o textură bogată, dar negrasă, crema se absoarbe rapid pentru a înmuia picioarele uscate cu caju și unt de shea. Extractul de arnică ameliorează oboseala și oferă o senzație de confort. Extractul de smirnă întărește unghiile. Crema ajută la păstrarea frumuseții și sensibilității picioarelor de la glezne până la degete.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Tip de piele: normală, uscată</li>\r\n	<li>Textura: crema</li>\r\n	<li>Aplicare: Se foloseste in fiecare zi dimineata si/sau seara</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>AQUA/WATER/EAU, GLYCERIN, PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM/MINERAL OIL/HUILE MINERALE, ALCOHOL, GLYCERYL STEARATE SE, STEARIC ACID, CETYL ALCOHOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, CYCLOMETHICONE, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL DICAPRYLATE/DICAPRATE, OCTYLDODECANOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER UNSAPONIFIABLES, CETYL PALMITATE, SODIUM MAGNESIUM SILICATE, ANACARDIUM OCCIDENTALE (CASHEW) SEED OIL, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, ARNICA MONTANA FLOWER EXTRACT, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, POLYSORBATE 20, ALLANTOIN, CARBOMER, COMMIPHORA MYRRHA RESIN EXTRACT, THYMUS ZYGIS FLOWER OIL, BHT, BENZYL SALICYLATE, LINALOOL, BUTYLPHENYL METHYLPROPIONAL, LIMONENE, HEXYL CINNAMAL, CITRONELLOL, EUGENOL, CITRAL, [C1664B]</p>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\r\n<p>Se aplica dimineata si/sau seara cu miscari usoare de masaj de la degete catre glezne. Pentru calusuri, folosiți în mod regulat un exfoliant pentru picioare.</p>', '26781', '26781', '26781', 510, 0, 0, 0, '125 ml', 0, 0, 0, 0, 35, 80, 0, '', '', 'наносить утром и/или вечером на кожу ног.', 'Se aplica dimineata si/sau seara pe pielea picioarelor.', NULL, 'AQUA/WATER/EAU. GLYCERIN. COCO-CAPRYLATE/CAPRATE. ALCOHOL. GLYCERYL STEARATE SE. OCTYLDODECANOL. STEARIC ACID. BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER. CETYL ALCOHOL. PENTYLENE GLYCOL. CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE. CETYL PALMITATE. LITHIUM MAGNESIUM SODIUM SI', 'AQUA/WATER/EAU. GLYCERIN. COCO-CAPRYLATE/CAPRATE. ALCOHOL. GLYCERYL STEARATE SE. OCTYLDODECANOL. STEARIC ACID. BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER. CETYL ALCOHOL. PENTYLENE GLYCOL. CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE. CETYL PALMITATE. LITHIUM MAGNESIUM SODIUM SI', NULL, 'Женский', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2023-08-01 00:00:00', '2023-07-28 17:30:02', 306, '3666057190018', 0, '80101831/80085057 FOOT BEAUTY TREATMENT CREAM \"CLARINS\"'),
(2666, '26782', '26782', 'CLARINS Nettoyant Visage Очищающий гель для умывания для мужчин', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Nettoyant Visage Gel de curatarea fetei pentru barbati', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Nettoyant Visage Gel de curatarea fetei pentru barbati', '', '', '', '<p><strong> Объем: 125 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__section\">\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text what-is-it-accordion__clamp-text what-is-it-text-js\">Пенящийся крем-гель с легкой освежающей текстурой эффективно очищает кожу от загрязнений и нейтрализует воздействие жесткой воды.<br />\r\nФормула на основе экстрактов гаультерии и гринделии тонизирует и наполняет кожу энергией, дарит ощущение чистоты, свежести и комфорта.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"what-is-it-accordion__list\">\r\n	<li class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text-medium\">Тип кожи: </span>Для любого типа кожи</li>\r\n	<li class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text-medium\">Текстура: </span>Гель</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"discover-more-benefit-section__title\">Ключевые преимущества</div>\r\n<div class=\"discover-more-benefit-section__text\">\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Удаляет загрязнения</li>\r\n	<li>Выводит токсины</li>\r\n	<li>Нейтрализует воздействие жесткой воды</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Компоненты</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU, SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, GLYCOL DISTEARATE, SODIUM LAUROYL SARCOSINATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SODIUM COCOAMPHOACETATE, DIMETHICONE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, GLYCERIN, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PHENOXYISOPROPANOL, SODIUM CHLORIDE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, PANTHENOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, COCAMIDE MIPA, PORTULACA OLERACEA EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, GAULTHERIA PROCUMBENS (WINTERGREEN) LEAF EXTRACT, SODIUM CETEARYL SULFATE, SODIUM LAURYL SULFATE, HIEROCHLOE ODORATA EXTRACT, GRINDELIA ROBUSTA EXTRACT, ALPINIA OFFICINARUM ROOT EXTRACT, METHYLCHLOROISOTHIAZOLINONE, DISODIUM EDTA, METHYLISOTHIAZOLINONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, HEXYL CINNAMAL, BUTYLPHENYL METHYLPROPIONAL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, BENZYL BENZOATE, CITRAL, CI 60730/EXT.VIOLET 2, CI 42090/BLUE 1, [C0556G]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Применение</strong></span></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--left flex-align-vertical-center\">\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--text\">\r\n<div class=\"full-width\">Используйте гель утром, чтобы пробудить кожу и подготовить ее к бритью, и вечером, чтобы очистить ее от накопившихся за день загрязнений. Вспеньте гель на влажной коже лица, а затем смойте прохладной водой.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--right flex-align-vertical-center\">\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__video how-to-block-video-js flex-align-vertical-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>', '<p><strong> Volum: 125 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Crema-gel spumant cu o textura usoara racoritoare curata eficient pielea de impuritati si neutralizeaza efectele apei dure.<br />\r\nFormula pe baza de iarna si grindelia extrage tonuri si umple pielea de energie, ofera o senzatie de curatenie, prospetime si confort.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Tip de piele: Pentru orice tip de piele</li>\r\n	<li>Textura: Gel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Beneficii cheie</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Îndepărtează impuritățile</li>\r\n	<li>Îndepărtează toxinele</li>\r\n	<li>Neutralizează efectele apei dure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU, SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, GLYCOL DISTEARATE, SODIUM LAUROYL SARCOSINATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SODIUM COCOAMPHOACETATE, DIMETHICONE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, GLYCERIN, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PHENOXYISOPROPANOL, SODIUM CHLORIDE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, PANTHENOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, COCAMIDE MIPA, PORTULACA OLERACEA EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, GAULTHERIA PROCUMBENS (WINTERGREEN) LEAF EXTRACT, SODIUM CETEARYL SULFATE, SODIUM LAURYL SULFATE, HIEROCHLOE ODORATA EXTRACT, GRINDELIA ROBUSTA EXTRACT, ALPINIA OFFICINARUM ROOT EXTRACT, METHYLCHLOROISOTHIAZOLINONE, DISODIUM EDTA, METHYLISOTHIAZOLINONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, HEXYL CINNAMAL, BUTYLPHENYL METHYLPROPIONAL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, BENZYL BENZOATE, CITRAL, CI 60730/EXT.VIOLET 2, CI 42090/BLUE 1, [C0556G]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\r\n<p>Folosește gelul dimineața pentru a trezi pielea și a o pregăti pentru bărbierit, iar seara pentru a o curăța de impuritățile acumulate în timpul zilei. Spumați gelul pe fața umedă și apoi clătiți cu apă rece.</p>', '<p><strong> Volum: 125 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Crema-gel spumant cu o textura usoara racoritoare curata eficient pielea de impuritati si neutralizeaza efectele apei dure.<br />\r\nFormula pe baza de iarna si grindelia extrage tonuri si umple pielea de energie, ofera o senzatie de curatenie, prospetime si confort.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Tip de piele: Pentru orice tip de piele</li>\r\n	<li>Textura: Gel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Beneficii cheie</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Îndepărtează impuritățile</li>\r\n	<li>Îndepărtează toxinele</li>\r\n	<li>Neutralizează efectele apei dure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU, SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, GLYCOL DISTEARATE, SODIUM LAUROYL SARCOSINATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SODIUM COCOAMPHOACETATE, DIMETHICONE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, GLYCERIN, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PHENOXYISOPROPANOL, SODIUM CHLORIDE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, PANTHENOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, COCAMIDE MIPA, PORTULACA OLERACEA EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, GAULTHERIA PROCUMBENS (WINTERGREEN) LEAF EXTRACT, SODIUM CETEARYL SULFATE, SODIUM LAURYL SULFATE, HIEROCHLOE ODORATA EXTRACT, GRINDELIA ROBUSTA EXTRACT, ALPINIA OFFICINARUM ROOT EXTRACT, METHYLCHLOROISOTHIAZOLINONE, DISODIUM EDTA, METHYLISOTHIAZOLINONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, HEXYL CINNAMAL, BUTYLPHENYL METHYLPROPIONAL, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, BENZYL BENZOATE, CITRAL, CI 60730/EXT.VIOLET 2, CI 42090/BLUE 1, [C0556G]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\r\n<p>Folosește gelul dimineața pentru a trezi pielea și a o pregăti pentru bărbierit, iar seara pentru a o curăța de impuritățile acumulate în timpul zilei. Spumați gelul pe fața umedă și apoi clătiți cu apă rece.</p>', '26782', '26782', '26782', 580, 0, 0, 0, '125 ml', 16, 1, 0, 0, 43, 80, 0, '', '', 'Используйте гель утром, чтобы пробудить кожу и подготовить ее к бритью, и вечером, чтобы очистить ее от накопившихся за день загрязнений. Вспеньте гель на влажной коже лица, а затем смойте прохладной водой.', 'Folosește gelul dimineața pentru a trezi pielea și a o pregăti pentru bărbierit, iar seara pentru a o curăța de impuritățile acumulate în timpul zilei. Spumați gelul pe fața umedă și apoi clătiți cu apă rece.', NULL, 'AQUA/WATER/EAU, SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, GLYCOL DISTEARATE, SODIUM LAUROYL SARCOSINATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SODIUM COCOAMPHOACETATE, DIMETHICONE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, GLYCERIN, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PHENOXYISOPROPANOL, SO', 'AQUA/WATER/EAU, SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, GLYCOL DISTEARATE, SODIUM LAUROYL SARCOSINATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SODIUM COCOAMPHOACETATE, DIMETHICONE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, GLYCERIN, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PHENOXYISOPROPANOL, SO', NULL, 'Мужской', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2023-08-01 00:00:00', '2023-07-28 17:30:02', 348, '3666057042317', 15, '80085184 MAN FACE WASH 125ML \" CLARINS\"'),
(2668, '26789', '26789', 'CLARINS Total Eye Contour Охлаждающий гель для устранения следов усталости вокруг глаз', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Total Eye Contour Gel răcoritor pentru a elimina semnele de oboseală din jurul ochilor', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Total Eye Contour Gel răcoritor pentru a elimina semnele de oboseală din jurul ochilor', '', '', '', '<p><strong> Объем: 20 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__section\">\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text what-is-it-accordion__clamp-text what-is-it-text-js\">Гель с легкой нежирной текстурой оказывает моментальный освежающий эффект и устраняет следы усталости под глазами, возвращая взгляду сияющий отдохнувший вид. Формула на основе растительных экстрактов и кофеина стимулирует микроциркуляцию, оказывает дренирующее действие, способствуя заметному сокращению темных кругов и отеков. Средство подходит даже для очень чувствительной кожи.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"what-is-it-accordion__list\">\r\n	<li class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text-medium\">Тип кожи: </span>Комбинированная, Сухая, Нормальная, Жирная</li>\r\n	<li class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text-medium\">Текстура: </span>Гель</li>\r\n	<li class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text-medium\">Применение: </span>Используйте утром и/или вечером </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"discover-more-benefit-section__title\">Ключевые преимущества</div>\r\n<div class=\"discover-more-benefit-section__text\">Устраняет отеки. Сокращает темные круги. Придает взгляду сияние.</div>\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__section\">\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__title\">Clarins +</div>\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text\">Моментальное устранение следов усталости и освежающий эффект.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Компоненты</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU. ROSA DAMASCENA FLOWER WATER. CITRUS AURANTIUM AMARA (BITTER ORANGE) FLOWER WATER. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. GLYCERIN. CARBOMER. CAFFEINE. PROPYLENE GLYCOL. PHENOXYETHANOL. ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN. SODIUM HYDROXIDE. ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF JUICE POWDER. CITRIC ACID. GINKGO BILOBA LEAF EXTRACT. BENZYL ALCOHOL. CENTAUREA CYANUS FLOWER EXTRACT. MARRUBIUM VULGARE EXTRACT. SODIUM BENZOATE. POTASSIUM SORBATE. CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA (MATRICARIA) FLOWER EXTRACT. PHENETHYL ALCOHOL. DEHYDROACETIC ACID. FURCELLARIA LUMBRICALIS EXTRACT. CI 42090/BLUE 1. LAPSANA COMMUNIS FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT. MARIS SAL/SEA SALT/SEL MARIN [4002A]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Применение</strong></span></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--left flex-align-vertical-center\">\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--text\">\r\n<div class=\"full-width\">Наносите гель легкими надавливающими движениями подушечками пальцев от внутренних углов глаз к внешним.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--right flex-align-vertical-center\">\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__image flex-align-vertical-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>', '<p><strong> Volum: 20 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Gelul cu o textura usoara non-grasa are un efect instantaneu de revigorare si elimina semnele de oboseala de sub ochi, redand aspectul unui aspect radiant, odihnit. Formula pe baza de extracte de plante si cofeina stimuleaza microcirculatia, are efect de drenaj, contribuind la reducerea vizibila a cearcanelor si a umflaturii. Produsul este potrivit chiar și pentru pielea foarte sensibilă.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Tipul tenului: mixt, uscat, normal, gras</li>\r\n	<li>Textura: Gel</li>\r\n	<li>Aplicare: Se foloseste dimineata si/sau seara</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Beneficii cheie<br />\r\nElimină umflarea. Reduce cercurile intunecate. Oferă strălucire ochilor.<br />\r\nClarins +<br />\r\nEliminarea instantanee a urmelor de oboseala si un efect revigorant.</p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU. ROSA DAMASCENA FLOWER WATER. CITRUS AURANTIUM AMARA (BITTER ORANGE) FLOWER WATER. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. GLYCERIN. CARBOMER. CAFFEINE. PROPYLENE GLYCOL. PHENOXYETHANOL. ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN. SODIUM HYDROXIDE. ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF JUICE POWDER. CITRIC ACID. GINKGO BILOBA LEAF EXTRACT. BENZYL ALCOHOL. CENTAUREA CYANUS FLOWER EXTRACT. MARRUBIUM VULGARE EXTRACT. SODIUM BENZOATE. POTASSIUM SORBATE. CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA (MATRICARIA) FLOWER EXTRACT. PHENETHYL ALCOHOL. DEHYDROACETIC ACID. FURCELLARIA LUMBRICALIS EXTRACT. CI 42090/BLUE 1. LAPSANA COMMUNIS FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT. MARIS SAL/SEA SALT/SEL MARIN [4002A]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\r\n<p>Aplica gelul cu miscari usoare de presiune cu varful degetelor de la colturile interioare ale ochilor catre cele exterioare.</p>', '<p><strong> Volum: 20 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Gelul cu o textura usoara non-grasa are un efect instantaneu de revigorare si elimina semnele de oboseala de sub ochi, redand aspectul unui aspect radiant, odihnit. Formula pe baza de extracte de plante si cofeina stimuleaza microcirculatia, are efect de drenaj, contribuind la reducerea vizibila a cearcanelor si a umflaturii. Produsul este potrivit chiar și pentru pielea foarte sensibilă.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Tipul tenului: mixt, uscat, normal, gras</li>\r\n	<li>Textura: Gel</li>\r\n	<li>Aplicare: Se foloseste dimineata si/sau seara</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Beneficii cheie<br />\r\nElimină umflarea. Reduce cercurile intunecate. Oferă strălucire ochilor.<br />\r\nClarins +<br />\r\nEliminarea instantanee a urmelor de oboseala si un efect revigorant.</p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU. ROSA DAMASCENA FLOWER WATER. CITRUS AURANTIUM AMARA (BITTER ORANGE) FLOWER WATER. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. GLYCERIN. CARBOMER. CAFFEINE. PROPYLENE GLYCOL. PHENOXYETHANOL. ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN. SODIUM HYDROXIDE. ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF JUICE POWDER. CITRIC ACID. GINKGO BILOBA LEAF EXTRACT. BENZYL ALCOHOL. CENTAUREA CYANUS FLOWER EXTRACT. MARRUBIUM VULGARE EXTRACT. SODIUM BENZOATE. POTASSIUM SORBATE. CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA (MATRICARIA) FLOWER EXTRACT. PHENETHYL ALCOHOL. DEHYDROACETIC ACID. FURCELLARIA LUMBRICALIS EXTRACT. CI 42090/BLUE 1. LAPSANA COMMUNIS FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT. MARIS SAL/SEA SALT/SEL MARIN [4002A]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\r\n<p>Aplica gelul cu miscari usoare de presiune cu varful degetelor de la colturile interioare ale ochilor catre cele exterioare.</p>', '26789', '26789', '26789', 860, 0, 0, 0, '20 ml', 10, 1, 0, 0, 40, 80, 0, '', '', 'Используйте утром и вечером. Наносите легкими надавливающими движениями на кожу вокруг глаз по направлению от внутренних углов к внешним.', 'Utilizați dimineața și seara. Se aplica cu miscari usoare de presiune pe pielea din jurul ochilor in directia de la colturile interioare catre cele exterioare.', NULL, 'AQUA/WATER/EAU · ROSA DAMASCENA FLOWER WATER · CITRUS AURANTIUM AMARA (BITTER ORANGE) FLOWER WATER · BUTYLENE GLYCOL · GLYCERIN · CARBOMER · CAFFEINE · PROPYLENE GLYCOL · PHENOXYETHANOL · ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN · SODIUM HYDROXIDE · ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF JUIC', 'AQUA/WATER/EAU · ROSA DAMASCENA FLOWER WATER · CITRUS AURANTIUM AMARA (BITTER ORANGE) FLOWER WATER · BUTYLENE GLYCOL · GLYCERIN · CARBOMER · CAFFEINE · PROPYLENE GLYCOL · PHENOXYETHANOL · ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN · SODIUM HYDROXIDE · ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF JUIC', NULL, 'Женский', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2024-01-15 00:00:00', '2023-07-28 17:30:02', 516, '3666057012822', 9, '80081840 TOTAL EYE BLUE GEL 20 ML \" CLARINS\"'),
(2669, '26790', '26790', 'CLARINS Total Eye Hydrate Увлажняющая маска-бальзам для кожи вокруг глаз', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Total Eye Hydrate Mască-balsam hidratant pentru pielea din jurul ochilor', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Total Eye Hydrate Mască-balsam hidratant pentru pielea din jurul ochilor', '', '', '', '<p><strong> Объем: 20 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__section\">\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text what-is-it-accordion__clamp-text what-is-it-text-js\">Маска с легкой кремово-гелевой текстурой оказывает интенсивное увлажняющее и освежающее действие, моментально устраняя следы усталости и возвращая глазам здоровый блеск.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"what-is-it-accordion__list\">\r\n	<li class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text-medium\">Применение: </span>Наносите маску по мере необходимости </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"discover-more-benefit-section__title\">Ключевые преимущества</div>\r\n<div class=\"discover-more-benefit-section__text\">\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>интенсивно увлажняет</li>\r\n	<li>оказывает освежающее действие</li>\r\n	<li>моментально устраняет следы усталости</li>\r\n	<li>возвращает глазам здоровый блеск</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__section\">\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__title\">Clarins +</div>\r\n<div class=\"what-is-it-accordion__text\">Уникальная текстура прекрасно ложится на кожу вокруг глаз и может оставаться на ней всю ночь.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Компоненты</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU. PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAETHYLHEXANOATE. PROPANEDIOL. GLYCERIN. CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER. SORBITAN CAPRYLATE. ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER. BORON NITRIDE. XYLITYLGLUCOSIDE. PHENOXYETHANOL. HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMER. ANHYDROXYLITOL. ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN. CHENOPODIUM QUINOA SEED EXTRACT. SODIUM HYDROXIDE. XYLITOL. 1,2-HEXANEDIOL. ESCIN. PARFUM/FRAGRANCE. CHONDRUS CRISPUS EXTRACT. DISODIUM EDTA. BIOSACCHARIDE GUM-4. GLUCOSE. KALANCHOE PINNATA LEAF EXTRACT. MARRUBIUM VULGARE EXTRACT. CITRIC ACID. SODIUM BENZOATE. PHENETHYL ALCOHOL. FURCELLARIA LUMBRICALIS EXTRACT. POTASSIUM SORBATE. CI 42090/BLUE 1. LAPSANA COMMUNIS FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT. MARIS SAL/SEA SALT/SEL MARIN [V3931A]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Применение</strong></span></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--left flex-align-vertical-center\">\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--text\">\r\n<div class=\"full-width\">Наносите маску сначала на верхние веки, а затем - на кожу под глазами. Используйте в качестве: 1.Экспресс-маски на 10 минут по мере необходимости. 2.Ночной маски 1-2 раза в неделю. Удалите остатки ватным диском, смоченным тонизирующим лосьоном.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__upper--right flex-align-vertical-center\">\r\n<div class=\"how-to-block__image flex-align-vertical-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>', '<p><strong> Volum: 20 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Masca cu textură cremă-gel ușoară are un efect intens de hidratare și revigorare, eliminând instantaneu semnele de oboseală și redând ochiului o strălucire sănătoasă.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Aplicare: Aplicați masca după cum este necesar</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Beneficii cheie</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>hidratează intens</li>\r\n	<li>are efect revigorant</li>\r\n	<li>elimină instantaneu semnele de oboseală</li>\r\n	<li>redă o strălucire sănătoasă ochilor</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Clarins +<br />\r\nTextura unică aderă frumos la pielea din jurul ochilor și poate rămâne pe ea toată noaptea.</p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU. PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAETHYLHEXANOATE. PROPANEDIOL. GLYCERIN. CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER. SORBITAN CAPRYLATE. ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER. BORON NITRIDE. XYLITYLGLUCOSIDE. PHENOXYETHANOL. HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMER. ANHYDROXYLITOL. ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN. CHENOPODIUM QUINOA SEED EXTRACT. SODIUM HYDROXIDE. XYLITOL. 1,2-HEXANEDIOL. ESCIN. PARFUM/FRAGRANCE. CHONDRUS CRISPUS EXTRACT. DISODIUM EDTA. BIOSACCHARIDE GUM-4. GLUCOSE. KALANCHOE PINNATA LEAF EXTRACT. MARRUBIUM VULGARE EXTRACT. CITRIC ACID. SODIUM BENZOATE. PHENETHYL ALCOHOL. FURCELLARIA LUMBRICALIS EXTRACT. POTASSIUM SORBATE. CI 42090/BLUE 1. LAPSANA COMMUNIS FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT. MARIS SAL/SEA SALT/SEL MARIN [V3931A]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong> Volum: 20 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Masca cu textură cremă-gel ușoară are un efect intens de hidratare și revigorare, eliminând instantaneu semnele de oboseală și redând ochiului o strălucire sănătoasă.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Aplicare: Aplicați masca după cum este necesar</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Beneficii cheie</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>hidratează intens</li>\r\n	<li>are efect revigorant</li>\r\n	<li>elimină instantaneu semnele de oboseală</li>\r\n	<li>redă o strălucire sănătoasă ochilor</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Clarins +<br />\r\nTextura unică aderă frumos la pielea din jurul ochilor și poate rămâne pe ea toată noaptea.</p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"text-uppercase\">AQUA/WATER/EAU. PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAETHYLHEXANOATE. PROPANEDIOL. GLYCERIN. CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER. SORBITAN CAPRYLATE. ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER. BORON NITRIDE. XYLITYLGLUCOSIDE. PHENOXYETHANOL. HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMER. ANHYDROXYLITOL. ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN. CHENOPODIUM QUINOA SEED EXTRACT. SODIUM HYDROXIDE. XYLITOL. 1,2-HEXANEDIOL. ESCIN. PARFUM/FRAGRANCE. CHONDRUS CRISPUS EXTRACT. DISODIUM EDTA. BIOSACCHARIDE GUM-4. GLUCOSE. KALANCHOE PINNATA LEAF EXTRACT. MARRUBIUM VULGARE EXTRACT. CITRIC ACID. SODIUM BENZOATE. PHENETHYL ALCOHOL. FURCELLARIA LUMBRICALIS EXTRACT. POTASSIUM SORBATE. CI 42090/BLUE 1. LAPSANA COMMUNIS FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT. MARIS SAL/SEA SALT/SEL MARIN [V3931A]</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '26790', '26790', '26790', 860, 0, 0, 0, '20 ml', 0, 0, 0, 0, 40, 80, 0, '', '', 'Используйте утром и вечером. Наносите легкими надавливающими движениями на кожу вокруг глаз по направлению от внутренних углов к внешним.', 'Utilizați dimineața și seara. Se aplica cu miscari usoare de presiune pe pielea din jurul ochilor in directia de la colturile interioare catre cele exterioare.', NULL, 'AQUA/WATER/EAU. PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAETHYLHEXANOATE. PROPANEDIOL. GLYCERIN. CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER. SORBITAN CAPRYLATE. ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER. BORON NITRIDE. XYL', 'AQUA/WATER/EAU. PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAETHYLHEXANOATE. PROPANEDIOL. GLYCERIN. CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER. SORBITAN CAPRYLATE. ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER. BORON NITRIDE. XYL', NULL, 'Женский', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2023-08-01 00:00:00', '2023-07-28 17:30:02', 516, '3666057012839', 0, '80081841 TOTAL EYE HYDRATE 20 ML \" CLARIN