(3418, '25940', '610630bourjo', 'BOURJOIS БЛЕСК ДЛЯ ГУБ GLOSS FABULEUX', NULL, NULL, 'BOURJOIS LUCIU DE BUZE Fabuleux Gloss', NULL, NULL, 'BOURJOIS LUCIU DE BUZE Fabuleux Gloss', '', '', '', '<p><strong>Объем:3,5 мл</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span xss=\"removed\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Невероятный увлажняющий блеск придает ультраблестящее покрытие для неотразимой улыбки.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nЕго нелипкая формула ухода, обогащенная аргановым маслом и витамином Е, увлажняет ваши губы, обеспечивая абсолютный комфорт в течение 24 часов.</p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span xss=\"removed\"><strong>Компоненты</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>POLYBUTENE• HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE• PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM/MINERAL OIL/HUILE MINERALE• ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, ETHYLENE/PROPYLENE/STYRENE COPOLYMER• ETHYLHEXYL METHOXYCINNAMATE• PHENOXYETHANOL• PARFUM/FRAGRANCE• TOCOPHERYL ACETATE• BUTYLENE/ETHYLENE/STYRENE COPOLYMER• BUTYL METHOXYDIBENZOYLMETHANE• ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL• BENZYL ALCOHOL• LINALOOL• GERANIOL• ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE• CITRONELLOL• BHT (01 Glow\'Bally Chic)(03 Rose Charismatic)</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span xss=\"removed\"><strong>Применение</strong></span></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Нанести на губы с помощью аппликатора.</p>\r\n', '<p><strong>Volum:3.5 ml</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span xss=\"removed\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>O strălucire hidratantă incredibilă oferă un finisaj ultra-strălucitor pentru un zâmbet irezistibil.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nFormula sa de îngrijire nelipicioasă, îmbogățită cu ulei de argan și vitamina E, hidratează buzele pentru un confort absolut timp de 24 de ore.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span xss=\"removed\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>POLYBUTENE• HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE• PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM/MINERAL OIL/HUILE MINERALE• ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, ETHYLENE/PROPYLENE/STYRENE COPOLYMER• ETHYLHEXYL METHOXYCINNAMATE• PHENOXYETHANOL• PARFUM/FRAGRANCE• TOCOPHERYL ACETATE• BUTYLENE/ETHYLENE/STYRENE COPOLYMER• BUTYL METHOXYDIBENZOYLMETHANE• ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL• BENZYL ALCOHOL• LINALOOL• GERANIOL• ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE• CITRONELLOL• BHT (01 Glow\'Bally Chic)(03 Rose Charismatic)</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span xss=\"removed\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"UdTY9 BwTYAc\" data-location=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"kO6q6e\">Aplicați pe buze cu aplicatorul.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div></div>\r\n', '<p><strong> Volum:3.5 ml</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px\"><strong>Descrierea</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>O strălucire hidratantă incredibilă oferă un finisaj ultra-strălucitor pentru un zâmbet irezistibil.</p>\r\n<p><br />\r\nFormula sa de îngrijire nelipicioasă, îmbogățită cu ulei de argan și vitamina E, hidratează buzele pentru un confort absolut timp de 24 de ore.</p>\r\n<p class=\"productDescription\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px\"><strong>Componente</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>POLYBUTENE• HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE• PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM/MINERAL OIL/HUILE MINERALE• ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, ETHYLENE/PROPYLENE/STYRENE COPOLYMER• ETHYLHEXYL METHOXYCINNAMATE• PHENOXYETHANOL• PARFUM/FRAGRANCE• TOCOPHERYL ACETATE• BUTYLENE/ETHYLENE/STYRENE COPOLYMER• BUTYL METHOXYDIBENZOYLMETHANE• ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL• BENZYL ALCOHOL• LINALOOL• GERANIOL• ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE• CITRONELLOL• BHT (01 Glow\'Bally Chic)(03 Rose Charismatic)</p>\r\n<div class=\"howToApply\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px\"><strong>Aplicarea</strong></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"UdTY9 BwTYAc\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-location=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"kO6q6e\">Aplicați pe buze cu aplicatorul.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div> </div>', '25940', '25940', '25940', 215, 0, 0, 0, ' ', 30874274, 1, 0, 0, 117, 136, 0, '', '610630bourjo', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, ' 25940 09 25941 03 25942 02 25943 01 25944