, tămâie', NULL, 'Унисекс', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2023-08-30 00:00:00', '2023-08-28 16:30:02', 887.25, '3665032001189', 0, 'OJ-BOM-INF-100 BODY OIL MIST - INFUSION VELOURS 100ml'),
