te de inima: curmale, nuci prajite, miere Note de baza: ambra, vanilie, seminte de susan', NULL, 'Унисекс', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2023-08-30 00:00:00', '2023-08-28 16:30:02', 887.25, '3665032001288', 1, 'OJ-BOM-HAL-100 BODY OIL MIST - HALWA KISS 100ml');
