(8172, '101654', '101654', 'CLARINS Sun Body Cream SPF50+ Лосьон солнцезащитный СПФ50', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Sun Body Cream SPF50+', NULL, NULL, 'CLARINS Sun Body Cream SPF50+', '', '', '', '', '', '', '101654', '101654', '101654', 640, 0, 0, 0, '150 ml', 10, 1, 0, 0, 87, 80, 0, '', '', 'Распылите средство на чистую сухую кожу. Дайте ему полностью впитаться.', 'Pulverizează produsul pe pielea curată și uscată. Lasă să se absoarbă complet.', NULL, 'AQUA/WATER/EAU. C12-15 ALKYL BENZOATE. DIBUTYL ADIPATE. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. POLYSILICONE-15. ETHYLHEXYL SALICYLATE. ETHYLHEXYL TRIAZONE. DIETHYLAMINO HYDROXYBENZOYL HEXYL BENZOATE. POLYGLYCERYL-6 STEARATE. BUTYL METHOXYDIBENZOYLMETHANE. BIS-ETHYLHEXYLOXYPHE', 'AQUA/WATER/EAU. C12-15 ALKYL BENZOATE. DIBUTYL ADIPATE. BUTYLENE GLYCOL. POLYSILICONE-15. ETHYLHEXYL SALICYLATE. ETHYLHEXYL TRIAZONE. DIETHYLAMINO HYDROXYBENZOYL HEXYL BENZOATE. POLYGLYCERYL-6 STEARATE. BUTYL METHOXYDIBENZOYLMETHANE. BIS-ETHYLHEXYLOXYPHE', NULL, 'Женский', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, '2025-02-25 19:30:08', 384, '3666057288142', 8, '80111689 SUN BODY CR SPF50+ RETAIL 2025 150ML \" CLARINS\"'),
