 uscată, masează până la absorbția completă.', NULL, 'AQUA (WATER),SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE,COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE,PARFUM (FRAGRANCE),DISODIUM COCOAMPHODIACETATE,PEG-7 GLYCERYL COCOATE,POLYSORBATE 20,PEG-18 GLYCERYL OLEATE/COCOATE,SODIUM BENZOATE,SODIUM CHLORIDE,PEG-120 METHYL GLUCOSE DIOLEATE,PHENOXYETHANOL,', 'AQUA (WATER),SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE,COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE,PARFUM (FRAGRANCE),DISODIUM COCOAMPHODIACETATE,PEG-7 GLYCERYL COCOATE,POLYSORBATE 20,PEG-18 GLYCERYL OLEATE/COCOATE,SODIUM BENZOATE,SODIUM CHLORIDE,PEG-120 METHYL GLUCOSE DIOLEATE,PHENOXYETHANOL,', NULL, 'Женский', '', '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, '', '', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '2025-10-30 00:00:00', '2025-10-08 09:30:48', 384, '8011607406531', 0, '0B3U04A002 FLOWER ARTIST KIT L/D+L/C B.SAKURA \"PUPA\"');
