(10153, '107184', '05921', 'BOURJOIS Healthy Mix S.O.S Lip Oil Масло для губ', NULL, NULL, 'BOURJOIS Healthy Mix S.O.S Lip Oil Ulei pentru buze cu efect de hidratare', NULL, NULL, 'BOURJOIS Healthy Mix S.O.S Lip Oil Ulei pentru buze cu efect de hidratare', '', '', '', '', '', '', '107184', '107184', '107184', 270, 0, 0, 0, '4,5', 2, 1, 0, 0, 117, 136, 0, '', '05921', 'Нанесите на губы легкими движениями, от центра губ к уголкам. Повторите по мере необходимости. Нанесите на чистые и сухие губы', 'Aplicați pe buze prin tușe ușoare, din centrul buzelor spre colțuri. Se repetă după cum este necesar. Se aplică pe buzele curate și uscate', NULL, 'COCOGLYCERIDES, ETHYLCELLULOSE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, RUBUS IDAEUS (RASPBERRY) SEED OIL, ASCORBYL PALMITATE, PANTHENYL TRIACETATE, PERSEA GRATISSIMA (AVOCADO) OIL, POTASSIUM COCOYL HYDROLYZED COLLAGEN, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, PROPYL', 'COCOGLYCERIDES, ETHYLCELLULOSE, PARFUM/FRAGRANCE, RUBUS IDAEUS (RASPBERRY) SEED OIL, ASCORBYL PALMITATE, PANTHENYL TRIACETATE, PERSEA GRATISSIMA (AVOCADO) OIL, POTASSIUM COCOYL HYDROLYZED COLLAGEN, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, PROPYL', NULL, 'Женский', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, '2026-02-03 11:06:36', 108, '3616307094788', 0, '94788 BJS HLT LCARE 4.5 7GLAZING GLZ RED SE IV \"BOURJOIS\"'),
